Comma-ok assertion (ok && ce != nil) on gateway.Capture checks the top-level type only.
The *CodeError inside *OpError and the wrapped ErrDeclined MUST stay. The bare *CodeError (a non-nil literal)
is handled at run time; removing it is precise, keeping it (because of the extra ce != nil) is sound.
